WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
<v Dee>Say it again, Miss Pat. Slowly.</v>

00:03.500 --> 00:08.000
<v Pat>I don't repeat results for people who were sitting right here.</v>

00:11.500 --> 00:16.500
<v Uncle Ray>You played like you belonged in the chair. Both of you.</v>

00:16.500 --> 00:19.500
<v Dee>I wish he'd seen the end of it.</v>

00:19.500 --> 00:25.000
<v Pat>Coleman's next. He'll smell that confidence before you reach his door.</v>
